                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A system of transportation using telphers."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c922b828-33b2-4037-a3d0-e5b0630277d5",
                                                "sense_id": "582ff8e1-f814-3594-a74f-7bf1ae36b83a",
                                                "text": "In 1898, the ever-innovative Lancashire & Yorkshire Railway installed an overhead delivery system known as a 'telpher'. […] But the telpher at Manchester Victoria wasn't part of a crane. It was part of an extraordinary dual-railed overhead line, a little like a suspended monorail, with individually manned units that trundled high above the heads of passengers and staff, carrying goods from the Parcels Office to each platform."
                                            }
